- **Gland:** The greatest concentration of **glucose** (sugar) and **acid** taste buds is in the **tip** of the tongue.  
- **Salt** and **Garg** (salt) are most concentrated in the **middle** of the tongue.  
- **Acid** is also present in the **middle** and **bottom** of the tongue.  

