- \(g_0 = 9800\) mGal (gravitational acceleration at the Earth's surface at the mean Earth surface)
- \(a\) is the semi-axis of the Earth (semi-major axis)
- \(b\) is the semi-axis of the Earth (semi-minor axis)
- \(\theta\) is the angle from the equator (latitude)

Given:
