\[
g = 9800 \left(1 + \frac{9800}{900000} \cdot 0.999003125\right)
\]
\[
g = 9800 \left(1 + 0.0125\right)
\]
\[
g = 9800 \times 1.0125 = 9915 \text{ mGal}
\]

