     \]
     \[
     R_B = -k x_A \quad \text{(from at support B)}
     \]
   - Substituting into the sum of forces:
     \[
     k x_A - k x_A = 0 \quad \text{(sum of forces)}
     \]
     \[
     0 = 0
     \]
     The sum of forces equation is trivial and does not provide additional information.

