\[
v_e \times M = -90 \, \text{kg m/s}
\]

Solving for \(v_e\):

\[
v_e = \frac{-90}{M} = \frac{-90}{5.97 \times 10^{24}} = -1.5 \times 10^{-23} \, \text{m/s}
\]

The negative sign indicates that the Earth moves in the opposite direction to the cannonball. The recoil velocity is extremely small, as expected due to the large mass of the Earth.

